bunsen-meta-all
===============

This metapackage depends on all the packages installed in a full-sized
BunsenLabs system. It can be installed without recommends.


bunsen-meta-lite
================

This metapackage depends on a reduced selection of the packages needed for a 
BunsenLabs system. Some packages have been replaced with lighter alternatives.
It can be installed without recommends.


bunsen-meta-base
================

This metapackage depends on the minimum selection of packages needed for a 
BunsenLabs base system. Some packages have been replaced with lighter alternatives.
No firmware packages are included, presuming that installation will be on an
already working Debian command-line base system. Some users might need to install
other packages to get a normally working X session.
It can be installed without recommends.
